  "_readme": [
    "Single source of every preset colour. Edit here, then run: python3 scripts/build.py css",
    "Each preset has a dark and a light set. Optional keys: background, link, linkHover, codeTint.",
    "background: replaces the preview background. link / linkHover: replace the VS Code link colours.",
    "codeTint: colour of the inline-code box (defaults to the code colour). Tints and borders are derived automatically."
